invalid type: string "Software Paradigms \n• Software paradigms refer to the methods \nand steps, which are taken while designing \nthe software. \nDr Ghada Hamissa- Software Engineering 2025\n\n1) Operational \n• This tells us how well the software works in operations. \nIt can be measured on: \n Budget \n Usability \n Efficiency \n Correctness \n Functionality \n Dependability \n Security \n